  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Perfect for concerts, festivals, sporting events and more, this stadium-friendly clear Swinger Bag meets venue security standards with space for all the essentials. Part of The Coach Originals, a collection of archival-inspired bags that celebrates our legacy and authentic New York heritage, this streamlined clear PVC and smooth leather style is based on a 1987 Coach design reimagined for today. Featuring our iconic turnlock closure, the zip-top design has a short shoulder strap to sit just beneath the underarm and an adjustable leather crossbody strap for versatile wear or detach the straps and use as a pouch. Some styles are just too good to leave in the archives.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Clear PVC and smooth leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> N/A</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable handle with 8&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable strap with 24&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
